<title>HONG KONG: Shum Yip announces first final results.</title>
<headline>Shum Yip announces first final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	     N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)	nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	    N/A</p>
<p>    Net				60.74</p>
<p>    Turnover			 258.34</p>
<p>    Company name		   Shum Yip Investment Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		    N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	     N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Shum Yip, a flagship Hong Kong-listed vehicle of the Shenzhen municipal government, engages in property development and investment primarily in the Chinese city of Shenzhen, across the border from Hong Kong. It also provides transportation services in China, and between Hong Kong and China.</p>
<p>The company was listed on the Hong Kong stock exchange on March 7, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
